":"grok-4.7","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/api/review/scope.py:_resume_of_terminated call site"},{"chunk":2,"detail":"`seen` is not reset between the kill and the resume, and the slow reviewer appends the chunk body before it sleeps. After a kill, `seen` already contains `y_marker_zz` from the terminated invocation, so `assert \"y_marker_zz\" in got` is true even when the second `review` never calls the reviewer. A resume that only rewrites `evidence[\"reviewed\"]` to `[1, 2]` from the checkpoint (without sending chunk 2, and without re-sending `x_marker_zz`) satisfies every assert in `test_a_killed_review_resumes_from_the_next_chunk`, including `got.count(\"x_marker_zz\") == 1`. The same log also never checks that chunk 1’s stored finding is still on the gate, so “keep the finished outcome” is untested.","digest":"b5d278fb7fe42603","family":"xai","location":"tests/test_review_checkpoint.py:128","reviewer":"grok-4.7","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"tests/test_review_checkpoint.py:128"}],"chunks_total":2,"coverage":"2/2 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":13789,"diff_sha":"1384b491527ba8f3264bac0c9059d01c77e38d00ac0c6d2e5481ffc040d44ded","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in $HOME/src/ddflow/.ddflow/worktrees/DX-review-chunk-checkpoint","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":144.3,"family":"deepseek","findings":3,"max_chunk_chars":8000,"model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","output_digest":"62d501b7f37019d6","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/DX-review-chunk-checkpoint.critic.grok-4.7.20261108T062915Z-c7dc56f6.jsonl","reason":"","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1,2],"reviewed_head":"1e7c7e9e45ee732b3a998a4e8e7627ecd593a208","reviewed_paths":{"ddflow/api/review/gate.py":"100644 58f963d27b3ff50b8884e144d7f2d757a6aa00c5","ddflow/api/review/reviewers.py":"100644 96b6a411eeeadc01fb84f39bfe76564db3898c02","ddflow/api/review/run.py":"100644 b383b1438783db4c33fddc9ff9dc9c9dcb80f93c","